docs {
  Aptos indexer gRPC (Transaction Stream Service) via Alchemy.

  Endpoints:
  - Mainnet: `https://aptos-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/`
  - Testnet: `https://aptos-testnet.g.alchemy.com/`

  Authentication is the same as Alchemy's Solana/Sui gRPC:
  `X-Token: <api_key>` (set `api_key` in your Bruno environment).

  Proto source: https://github.com/aptos-labs/aptos-core/tree/main/protos/proto/aptos
}
